<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-American Residential at buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-American Residential at buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities said analyst Bo Cheadle initiated coverage of American Residential Services Inc on Monday with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3/4 to close at 20-7/8. It hit a new high of 21-1/8 in intraday trading.</p>
</text>
